{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-02T18:39:49.637Z","author":"pi-land","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"ee1d7c2ee2b2ffb19ec38748","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-02T18:39:49.637Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:39:49.636Z","author":"pi-land","text":"Greptile 4136613100 (setup failure skips cleanup) is valid: reproduced empirically on the pre-fix pattern (a rejected createExtensionTestHarness left one pm-slack temp directory in tmpdir). Fix: corpus tests now use a createCorpusFixture helper that registers the full teardown hook (harness deactivate, server close, directory removal) on the owning TestContext immediately after mkdtempSync, before any risky setup; added a regression pair asserting the directory is removed when later setup never runs. Release:check 265/265, zero skips."}]}],"before_hash":"6109cb46c1c25e3331ff1f7b16a026f729af5422d8df634cd42a8684f1f34349","after_hash":"60fb1459843f50dc6b67954f640cde3f789ccc6cd9424506511d083e73eda2b0","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"47a6da628fe1f03b333a8e35ecda7c21a298fa47d01acb779bff8b2fafa4e6ee"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-02T18:39:52.626Z","author":"pi-land","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"ee1d7c2ee2b2ffb19ec38748","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:39:52.626Z","author":"pi-land","text":"Greptile 4136613100-adjacent P1 4136613086 (standalone extension may not load) is refused: pm's installer links every installed package copy to the exact running host CLI (node_modules/@unbrained/pm-cli symlink, linkHostedPmCliDependency in pm-cli install-sources; EXTENSIONS.md: 'Runtime modules use static SDK imports; installed copies receive a host SDK link'), and pm-slack declared the peer dependency since its initial commit, so the listAllComplete import resolves for npm, GitHub, bundled, and local sources; the PR body records real npm/Node/Bun packed-install activation. The stale comment claiming '@unbrained/pm-cli is not resolvable at runtime' contradicted the import ten lines below it; corrected it to state the host-link contract and raw-entry precondition (docs EXTENSIONS.md standalone entries need the host SDK link before runtime SDK imports)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-02T18:39:52.626Z"}],"before_hash":"60fb1459843f50dc6b67954f640cde3f789ccc6cd9424506511d083e73eda2b0","after_hash":"afab4f3df7d13bff15a3889535fe89ae51c962e1155a639f9707954acdbe78b9","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"6fb3bdd5b6edf45dc891a63106bb0d355cd6cdfd4e5ccdc4d9b6c07b46b042e9"}
